{"id":"n18796-1-11","stage":1,"title":"칠판 · 黑板","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18796-1-11-1","ko":"여러분, 칠판 글씨가 잘 보이나요?","zh":"大家，黑板上的字看得清楚吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여러분,","meaning":"诸位，各位，大家","explanation":"여러분：诸位，各位，大家。","readings":[{"term":"여러분","audio":"/audio/b9900788f06b605eb770.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28028","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여러분","audio":"/audio/b9900788f06b605eb770.mp3"}},{"text":"칠판","meaning":"黑板","explanation":"칠판：黑板。","readings":[{"term":"칠판","audio":"/audio/8159b3904bd24a7d1a09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18796","senseId":"1","lemma":"칠판","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"칠판","audio":"/audio/8159b3904bd24a7d1a09.mp3"}},{"text":"글씨가","meaning":"字体，字迹，笔迹","explanation":"글씨：字体，字迹，笔迹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"글씨","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60239","senseId":"1","lemma":"글씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글씨가","audio":"/audio/030f21a5f7736b954e42.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"보이나요?","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이나요","audio":"/audio/aa3ffcb884fa7064c14d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b9900788f06b605e","term":"여러분","zh":"诸位，各位，大家","audio":"/audio/b9900788f06b605eb770.mp3","entryId":"28028","definition":"有多个听话人时对那些人的尊称。","pronunciation":["여러분"]},{"id":"8159b3904bd24a7d","term":"칠판","zh":"黑板","aud