9.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，洪亮，嘹亮","explanation":"크다：大，洪亮，嘹亮；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"6","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크게","audio":"/audio/39efead98c7d3ec847e3.mp3"}},{"text":"써","meaning":"写","explanation":"쓰다：写；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써","audio":"/audio/a56108d30e19595a1562.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"510fc81ede633cdb","term":"글씨","zh":"字体，字迹，笔迹","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3","entryId":"60239","definition":"书写的字的模样。","pronunciation":["글씨"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，洪亮，嘹亮","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"音量很高。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"用铅笔或其它笔等书写工具在纸张等上划线而书写一定的字。","pronu